          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "The Return of Ishtar",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Return of Ishtar, also known as Ishtar no Fukkatsu, is a two-player action-RPG that follows directly after Namco's Tower of Druaga. Ki and Gilgamesh must escape the Tower of Druaga, fighting through the legions of Druaga that are trying to avenge their fallen master.\n\nOne player controls Ki and the other controls Gilgamesh. Ki will instantly die if an enemy touches her but she has a ranged attack to keep opponents at bay, while Gilgamesh defeats any enemy he touches. However, Gilgamesh will die if he is forced to take on too many enemies on his own. The aim is to combine efforts to fight through enemies and explore each of the tower's rooms for valuable items.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The Return of Ishtar, también conocido como Ishtar no Fukkatsu, es un action-RPG para dos jugadores que continúa directamente después de The Tower of Druaga, de Namco. Ki y Gilgamesh deben escapar de la torre de Druaga, luchando contra las legiones de Druaga que intentan vengar a su difunto amo.\n\nUn jugador controla a Ki y el otro a Gilgamesh. Ki muere al instante si un enemigo la toca, pero tiene un ataque a distancia para mantener a raya a los oponentes, mientras que Gilgamesh derrota a cualquier enemigo que toque. Sin embargo, Gilgamesh morirá si se ve obligado a enfrentarse solo a demasiados enemigos. El objetivo es combinar esfuerzos para abrirse paso entre los enemigos y explorar cada una de las salas de la torre en busca de objetos valiosos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1986",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
