        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "\"VS. The Quest of Ki\" is an action game released by NAMCO (Bandai Namco Entertainment) in 1988.\nThe objective of the game is to recover the BLUE CRYSTAL ROD that has been stolen by DRUAGA.\nThe main character, KI, is controlled to reach the top of the tower where monsters are roaming around.",
